    <command:examples>
      <command:example>
        <maml:title>-------------- Example 1 - Copy a single folder. --------------</maml:title>
        <dev:code>PS C:\&gt; Copy-WithProgress -Source [SourcePath] -Destination [DestinationPath]

This example copies a single entry from -Source to -Destination.</dev:code>
        <dev:remarks>
          <maml:para></maml:para>
        </dev:remarks>
      </command:example>
      <command:example>
        <maml:title>-------------- Example 2 - Copy multiple folders. --------------</maml:title>
        <dev:code>PS C:\&gt; Copy-WithProgress -Object @(
	@{ Name = "Entry 1";    Source = [Source 1];    Destination = [Destination 1] }
	@{ Name = "Entry 2";    Source = [Source 2];    Destination = [Destination 2] }
	@{ Name = "Entry 3";    Source = [Source 3];    Destination = [Destination 3] }
)

This example runs throug the list of hashtables, copying them one by one from [Source] to [Destination] while displaying the [Name] in the progress bar.</dev:code>
        <dev:remarks>
          <maml:para></maml:para>
        </dev:remarks>
      </command:example>
